  "notes": "Columns used: 'Maximum Allowance Children' -> child, 'Maximum Allowance Adults' -> adult; 'N/A' = not covered for that group (key omitted). A third column 'Maximum Allowance Pregnant Women' equals the adult column for every requested code. Age-specific rows: D0120 child row 'Ages 0 thru 20' ($29.40), adult row 'Ages 21 and older and Pregnant Women' ($28.00); D1110 adult 'Ages 21 and Older and Pregnant Women'; D1120 'Ages 0 thru 20'; D1206 rows 'Ages 0 thru 18' and 'Ages 19 thru 20' both $27.30. Prior approval (Y) required e.g. for crowns D2740-D2790, dentures, D4910, D7220-D7250, ortho, IV sedation/GA; D4341 PA for children only. D8670 described 'Periodic Adjustments (11 maximum)'. Same values in the PDF version (07212026dentalfs.pdf). Most IL Medicaid members are in HealthChoice Illinois managed care; this is the FFS schedule.",
