  "notes_2024": "Edition in force on 2024-07-01: 'HFS Dental Program Fee Schedule for Child and Adult Beneficiaries Updated 12/21/22, Effective January 1, 2023' (listed on https://hfs.illinois.gov/medicalproviders/medicaidreimbursement/dental/archive.html). The HFS archive lists no 2024 edition; the next one is 'Updated 04-09-2025 Effective 01-01-2025'. Same column rules as current (child/adult; pregnant-women column equals adult). An HFS public notice of 2024-05-23 (effective 2024-07-01) only allowed medical anesthesiologists to bill dental anesthesia codes, described as budget neutral; it did not publish new fees."
